OL,3,GNEWSATeenager seriously hurt in
OL,4,Asuspected drink-drive crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for witnesses
OL,7,Fafter a crash that left a teenage boy
OL,8,Fseriously injured.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police said the
OL,11,Fcollision involved the driver of a
OL,12,Fblack Audi A4 and a cyclist. It
OL,13,Fhappened on Burleigh Road, near the
OL,14,Fjunction with Kingsthorpe Road in
OL,15,FNorthampton, at about 23:50 BST on
OL,16,FTuesday.
OL,18,FThe boy suffered serious injuries and
OL,19,Fwas taken to Birmingham Children's
OL,20,FHospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
