OL,3,GNEWSATeenager seriously hurt in
OL,4,Asuspected drink-drive crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers said a 20-year-old man from
OL,7,FNorthampton was arrested on suspicion
OL,8,Fof causing serious injury by careless
OL,9,Fdriving and driving whilst unfit
OL,10,Fthrough alcohol.
